1. after runnnig a search, add a button to move search results into a new window.
2. add tags to nodes. tags are user-defined text and color that are stored in their own table. tags are attached to nodes through a linking table.
3. update search to allow terms to be applied to individual fields by prepending them with the field name and a colon. Add a generated feild to the node table called domain that takes the url and parses out just the hostname to make searching for a domain easier. also make sure that labels can be targeted with `label:`
4. when searching, add the ability to label all found nodes with a label. when labeling a window, label all nodes in the window and any future nodes in that window. when removing a label from a window, leave the label on the existing nodes and just turn off the auto labeling of future nodes. 
5. add the ability to add custom actions that add labels or move tabs to certain windows based off either a search string or SQL statement. 
6. add something to show the schema for the SQL console... probably needs to be its own popup.
